      'Succession financing supports family transitions, management buyouts, and external acquisitions with various structures',
      'Management buyout financing may combine senior debt, mezzanine financing, and equity components',
      'Comprehensive transition plans demonstrating business continuity and financial viability support financing applications',
      'Early succession planning enables optimal financing structures and smooth ownership transfer implementation'
    ],
    internalLinks: ['/loans/business', '/faq']
